    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> bjorn3 created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14809#discussion_r4315272116\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>On arm64 this needs to actually be 16 byte aligned I believe. You could do something similar to <a href=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/rustc_codegen_cranelift/blob/8706691e403263efd4216f075caef2b189f3338e/src/common.rs#L397-L409\">https://github.com/rust-lang/rustc_codegen_cranelift/blob/8706691e403263efd4216f075caef2b189f3338e/src/common.rs#L397-L409</a> (basically double the stack slot size and then realign at runtime)</p>\n</blockquote>",
