    {
        "content": "<p>Gelbpunkt <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14809#issuecomment-6271200220\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14809\">PR #14809</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Runtests for s390x in CI are throwing SIGILL in qemu, that's weird. They pass for me locally in qemu-user and also natively on z15. Is the QEMU in CI just too old or what's going on here? <span aria-label=\"thinking\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f914\" role=\"img\" title=\"thinking\">:thinking:</span> </p>\n</blockquote>",
